       },
       "modules": {
        "typeStyles": {
         "content": {
          "title": "Diffuse Light in a Splash of Colors",
          "description": "From soft pastels to vibrant candy hues, Bambu PLA Translucent offers a stunning range of frosted tones that add both subtle elegance and bold vibrancy to your prints. Its unique matte finish mimics the look of hand-blown frosted glass, making it ideal for crafting light shades, vases, and stained glass decor. PLA Translucent seamlessly bonds with any PLA filament, making adding a translucent accent to your prints as effortless as swapping colors mid‑print."
         }
        },
